Description: Estimates adjudication strength and liminality for predictive
    modelling goals from six components: label determinacy, construct
    stability, predictive multiplicity, attainable discriminability, oracle
    strength and normative consensus. Includes bootstrap uncertainty,
    weight sensitivity, leakage auditing and five benchmark scenarios of
    increasing liminality.
